# Mobile PWA build output, published into apps/web by
# apps/mobile/scripts/emit-to-web.mjs. All three are generated:
# public/m holds the hashed assets, mobile-shell holds the per-accent
# HTML variants + build marker, and .mobile-stage is the atomic-swap
# staging area (cleared on every publish, but ignored so an interrupted
# build can never be committed or swept into a Docker context).
apps/web/public/m/
apps/web/mobile-shell/
apps/web/.mobile-stage/
